PROCEDURE calculateDiscount(price, discountRate)
{
   discountAmount ← price * discountRate
   finalPrice ← price + discountAmount
   RETURN finalPrice
}

Consider the following code segment, which is intended to calculate the letter grade for a student:

PROCEDURE getGrade(score)
{
   IF(score >= 90)
   {
      RETURN("A")
   }
   IF(score >= 80)
   {
      RETURN("B")
   }
   IF(score >= 70)
   {
      RETURN("C")
   }
   RETURN("F")
}
